<title>MOLDOVA: Moldova specialised insurance bond yield unchanged.</title>
<headline>Moldova specialised insurance bond yield unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The yield on Moldovan 365-day specialised insurance bonds was unchanged on Tuesday at 34.35 percent annual from the previous auction on January 14, a National Bank official told Reuters.</p>
<p>Full details of the 365-day insurance bonds auction:</p>
<p>				Feb 25	   Jan 14</p>
<p> Issue volume		3.00 million lei   2.00 million lei</p>
<p> Denominations	     1,000 lei	1,000 lei</p>
<p> Nominal demand	    31.79 million	5.96 million</p>
<p> Volume sold		 2.7 million	  0.3 million</p>
<p> Yield			 34.35 pct	34.35 pct</p>
<p> Price			 85.6 pct	 85.6 pct</p>
<p> Range of bids	     85.6-92.0 pct  85.6-87.5 pct</p>
<p> Maturity		    Feb 27, 1998   Jan 16, 1998</p>
<p>NOTE: The yield includes fixed annual interest of 15 percent guaranteed by the Finance Ministry.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
